## Stack Reference by Submodule

### `store-desk-electron/`
- Electron + Vite + React 18 + TypeScript + MUI v5
- TanStack Query, React Hook Form, Zod, Material React Table, React Router v6
- Tests: Vitest at `tests/` (not `src/tests/`)
- **Smart client:** uses `http://localhost:4310` always (same store PC, direct loopback). If Worker is dead → localhost dead → tunnel equally dead (cloudflared forwards to the same dead port). No fallback exists. Tunnel URL only if Electron runs on a different machine (non-standard).
- `ManageWorkerPage.tsx` — service control UI. HTTP to Worker `/setup/v1/*` only — never shells to service orchestration directly.
- Verify: `npm run check`


### `store-desk-worker/` — Edge API
```
Runtime:   Node.js + Express + TypeScript
DB:        MongoDB local + Mongoose
Validate:  Zod
Auth:      JWT (mobile) / signed token
Test:      Vitest (requires BypassSandbox — TCP loopback)
Structure: routes/ → controllers/ → services/ → models/
```

### `store-desk-mobile/`
- Flutter + Dart + Material 3 + go_router + flutter_riverpod + dio
- IDE: Android Studio
- **Network:** always connects via `https://<store-id>.storedesk.net` (Cloudflare Tunnel). Never `localhost`. Never raw LAN IP.
- Verify: `flutter analyze && flutter test`

### `store-desk-web/` — License & Download Portal
```
Runtime:   Next.js + React + TypeScript
Deploy:    Vercel / Cloudflare Pages
Release:   Update LATEST_RELEASE_TAG in DownloadClient.tsx before every release tag.
```

