## Verification Commands per Submodule

| Submodule | Verify Command |
|-----------|---------------|
| `store-desk-electron/` | `npm run check` (tsc + vitest) |
| `store-desk-worker/` | `npm run check` (bypass sandbox — TCP required) |
| `store-desk-mobile/` | `flutter analyze && flutter test` |
| `store-desk-web/` | `npm run build` (type check + build) |

